{"work_id":"raja-rani","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-017.md","record_count":48,"records":[{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d001","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"கீதா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வாங்க...வாங்க!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d002","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பாபு இல்லே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d003","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"தாயம்மாள்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வந்துடுவாரு. வாங்க தம்பி, வாங்க, உட்காருங்க. இப்பத்தான் உங்களைப் பத்தி பேசிக்கிட்டே இருந்தோம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d004","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னைப் பத்தியா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d005","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"தாயம்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாங்க.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d006","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d007","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"கீதா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அன்னைக்கு நாடகத்திலே உங்க நடிப்பு ரொம்ப பிரமாதம்—நானே உணர்ச்சி வசப்பட்டுவிட்டேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d008","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஹ...ஹ...தேங்க்ஸ்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d009","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"தாயம்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கீதா 'போர்ஷனை'த்தான் ரொம்ப குறைச்சிட்டீங்களே தம்பி...உம்...ஒரு சீனுகூட முழுசா இல்லையே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d010","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நான் என்ன செய்யறது? அதுக்கெல்லாம் பொறுப்பு பாபுதான். உம்...கதையும் அதுமாதிரி! பரவாயில்லை, அடுத்த புது நாடகத்திலே...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d011","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"வேலைக்கார சிறுமி பிரேமா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"புதுநாடகத்துலே எனக்குக் கூட ஒரு சான்ஸ் கிடைக்குமா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d012","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆங்—","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d013","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"கீதா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சீ, போடி! பார்த்தியாம்மா இந்தப் பொடியை! உம்—எனக்கே சான்ஸ் கிடைக்கலியாம்—இவளுக்கு சான்ஸாம் சான்ஸ்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d014","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"தாயம்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பிரேமா! வாயை மூடு! அதுக சின்னஞ்சிறிசுக தமாஷா பேசிக்கிட்டு இருக்கும்போது—கீதா, தம்பியை மாடிக்கு அழைச்சிட்டுப் போறதுதானே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d015","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யோ, வேண்டாம்! நான் இங்கேயே இருக்கேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d016","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"தாயம்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சரி! வாடி, போவோம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d017","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"கீதா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"புது நாடகம்னு எதுவா இருக்கலாம்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d018","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பாபு உங்கிட்டே சொல்லலே? ரெண்டு மூணு கதையிருக்கு! லைலா மஜ்னு, அனார்கலி, அகல்யா தேவி...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d019","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"கீதா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கம்ப்ளீட் லவ் ஸ்டோரியா இருந்தா ரொம்ப நல்லாயிருக்கும் நம்ப ரெண்டுபேரும் காதலனும் காதலியா ஒரு 'புல்' நாடகத்திலே நடிக்கணும்னு எனக்கு ரொம்ப ஆசையாயிருக்கு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":31,"printed_page":30}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d020","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதுக்கு என்னம்மா—ஆக்ட் பண்ணினா போச்சு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d021","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"கீதா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஹும், நாடகத்திலாவது என் ஆசை நிறைவேறட்டும்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d022","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீ என்ன சொல்றே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d023","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"கீதா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"புரியலியா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d024","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஊஹூம்...!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d025","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"கீதா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வசனங்களை மிடுக்காகவும் அழகாகவும் பேசத்தான் தெரியும் போலிருக்கிறது—அதன் உட்பொருளை புரிந்து கொள்ள முடியதாக்கும்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d026","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஓஹோ...உட்பொருளைப் புரிஞ்சுக்கிட்ட சமயத்திலே கைப்பொருளுக்கே ஆபத்து வந்துடும்மா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d027","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"கீதா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"புனிதமான காதல், பொருளை எதிர்பார்த்து ஏற்படுவதில்லையே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d028","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இந்தாம்மா! நான் இங்க வந்தது பாபுவைப் பார்த்து புதிய நாடகம் பற்றி பேசுவதற்காக!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d029","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"கீதா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதைத்தான் நானும் சொல்றேன், காதல் நாடகம் நடத்துவோம்னு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d030","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நான் சொல்ற நாடகம், ஆயிரம் பேருக்கு முன்னாலே அழகான மேடை போட்டு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d031","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"கீதா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அக்கினி சாட்சியா...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d032","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீ என்னம்மா நீ டேஞ்சர் பண்றே—சரி, சரி, நான் போறேன்...பாபு வந்தான்னா...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d033","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"கீதா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"[சட்டையை இழுத்து] இருங்கள் போகலாம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d034","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன மிஸ்டர் ராஜா, எங்கே இது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d035","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வா பாபு! உன்னைப் பார்க்க வந்தேன், நம்ப புது நாடக சம்பந்தமாக! அகல்யா நாடகத்துக்கு வனம் எல்லாம் ரெடியாயிருக்கு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d036","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இப்ப ஒன்னும் புது நாடகம் நடத்துவதாக உத்தேசமில்லை.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d037","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஏம்ப்பா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d038","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சில பசங்க, கலையை ஆதரிக்கேன்; நாடகத்தை வளர்க்கறேன்னு கதை அளந்துட்டு, கடைசிலே கலையை வளர்க்க கிளம்பி விடுறானுங்க!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d039","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நம்ப அமெச்சூர் கம்பெனியிலே அது மாதிரி ஆளு யாருமில்லையே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d040","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஏன் இல்லை? ராஜா வேஷம் போட்டவனெல்லாம் தன்னை ராஜான்னு நினைச்சுகிட்டு அலையறான்களே...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d041","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீ என்ன சொல்றே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":32,"printed_page":31}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d042","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"விளக்கம் வேறு தேவையோ? இத பார் ராஜா! இனிமேல் நீ நாடகம் கடகம்னு சொல்லிவிட்டு இங்க வரக்கூடாது! என் நாடகக் கம்பெனியிலே உனக்கு வேலை கிடையாது!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":33,"printed_page":32}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d043","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அட இதோ பாருப்பா? நான் ஒண்ணும் உங்கிட்ட வேலை தேடி வரவில்லை! எங்க 'எலக்ட்ரிக் ஸ்டோர்'ஸிலே நான் கொடுப்பேன் ஏழு பேருக்கு வேலை—தெரியுமா? என்னமோ, நாடகக் கலையிலே உள்ள பிரியத்தினாலே வந்தேன். அவ்வளவுதான்! எனக்கும் நாடகம் நடத்தத் தெரியும்பா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":33,"printed_page":32}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d044","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதை நிறுத்த எனக்கும் தெரியும்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":33,"printed_page":32}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d045","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அட, நல்லா இருந்தியே—ஏன் உனக்கு திடீரென்று இப்படி மூளைக் கோளாறு?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":33,"printed_page":32}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d046","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"திடீர்னு ஒண்ணுமில்லே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":33,"printed_page":32}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d047","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஓகோ! எப்பவும் அப்படித்தானா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":33,"printed_page":32}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s017-d048","scene_id":"raja-rani-s017","scene_ordinal":17,"transition_audit_id":"T017","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராஜா! உன்னை நான் மொதல் தடவையா மன்னிக்கிறேன். பிளீஸ் கெட்டவுட்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":33,"printed_page":32}],"source_scene_file":"scene-017.md"}]}
